## Solution
Using CUDA 11 to compile:
```
env LD_LIBRARY_PATH="/usr/lib/llvm-12/lib:/usr/local/cuda-11.8/lib64:/usr/local/cuda-11.8/nvvm/lib64" PATH="/usr/lib/llvm-12/bin:/usr/local/cuda-11.8/bin:/usr/local/cuda-11.8/nvvm/bin:/home/luxinliang/miniconda3/bin:/home/luxinliang/miniconda3/condabin:/home/luxinliang/.cabal/bin:/home/luxinliang/.ghcup/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin:/snap/bin:/snap/bin" stack build
```
